### ==========================================================================
### Week 3 — Assignment 2: Image Upload Feature API Tests
### VS Code REST Client Test Suite
### ==========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/api
@serverUrl = http://localhost:5001

### 1. Health Check
# @name healthCheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Storage Statistics Overview
# @name getStats
GET {{baseUrl}}/images/stats
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3. Get All Images (Default: Newest first)
# @name getAllImages
GET {{baseUrl}}/images
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Upload Single Image (Valid JPEG/PNG)
# Note: In REST Client, multipart file path is relative to the workspace or absolute.
# @name uploadSingle
POST {{baseUrl}}/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Cyberpunk Neon City
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

technology
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

A futuristic cybernetic metropolis glowing with violet and cyan neon lights.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tags"

cyberpunk,neon,city,future
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="sample-cyberpunk.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./sample.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 5. Negative Test: Upload Without File (Should return 400 Bad Request)
# @name uploadWithoutFile
POST {{baseUrl}}/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Image Missing File
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 6. Negative Test: Upload Invalid MIME Type (Should return 400 Bad Request)
# @name uploadInvalidMime
POST {{baseUrl}}/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Document File
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4 dummy pdf content
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 7. Filter Images by Category (e.g. category=technology)
# @name filterByCategory
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?category=technology
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 8. Search Images by Keyword in Title/Tags
# @name searchImages
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?search=cyberpunk
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 9. Sort Images by Size Descending (Largest files first)
# @name sortByLargest
GET {{baseUrl}}/images?sortBy=size_desc
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 10. Get Image by ID
# Replace {{imageId}} with an actual ObjectId returned from an upload or listing
@imageId = 66e857418a38c44d18fa9911
# @name getImageById
GET {{baseUrl}}/images/{{imageId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 11. Download Image File (Triggers attachment download)
# @name downloadImage
GET {{baseUrl}}/images/{{imageId}}/download

###

### 12. Delete Image by ID (Cascades to disk file in uploads/)
# @name deleteImage
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/images/{{imageId}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 13. Test Static File Serving
# @name testStaticServing
GET {{serverUrl}}/uploads/test-file.png
